What is the output of the following super method invocation program?
```java
class AlphaWorker {
    int compute(int x) {
        return x + 10;
    }
}
class BetaWorker extends AlphaWorker {
    @Override
    int compute(int x) {
        return super.compute(x) * 2;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        AlphaWorker aw = new BetaWorker();
        System.out.println(aw.compute(5));
    }
}
```

