What is the output of the following instanceof pattern matching program?
```java
class BaseNode {}
class BranchNode extends BaseNode {
    int size = 5;
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        BaseNode node = new BranchNode();
        if (node instanceof BranchNode bn) {
            System.out.println(bn.size * 2);
        } else {
            System.out.println("Not branch");
        }
    }
}
```
